      "adaptation_template": {
        "mutation_scales": [0.08, 0.3, 0.75,
          1.1],
        "stagnation_trials": 8,
        "action": "diversify"
      },
      "coefficients": [1.0, 0.12, 0.03, 0.03],
      "rationale": "Incident weight minus induced weight gives the frontier's crossing-edge pressure, separated from its internal conflicts. The supplied witness contains changed edges incident to distinct distance-two frontiers despite unchanged base9, Q and T; these features directly inspect that structural distinction without embedding node IDs or configuration labels. The 64-node cap can accommodate the witness's domain. Rejection-frontier anchoring, eight-contact destruction and RCL reconstruction revisit interacting failures. Lazy computation and the feature cap charge their cost; stagnation triggers diversification. No cycle resolution or performance improvement is certified."
    },
    {
